abstract: >-
  This web application is part of the research project
  "Lectures that Link", which investigates European Digital
  Humanities lecture series as nodes of interaction within
  the Digital Humanities community. The application provides
  interactive access to the project's research data and
  facilitates their exploration, analysis, and visualisation.